&lt;p>The question and introductory explanation were adapted from &lt;a href="https://www.astronomynotes.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ASTRO 801: Planets, Stars, Galaxies, and the Universe&lt;/a>.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>